error[E0571]: field 'n' has type 'Named', which a record cannot hold
 --> $DIR/field-interface.nra:5:20
  |
5 | let P = record (n: Named);
  |                    ^^^^^ 'Named' is an interface, whose implementations need not be records
  |
  = help: hold a record, a tuple or an enum of eligible types, or declare 'P' as an #Immutable class and not as a record

For more information about this error, try `neura explain E0571`.
